 *
 * @defgroup symmetry Symmetry
 * @brief Space group analysis via spglib
 *
 * @defgroup tools Utilities
 * @brief Chemistry helpers, physical constants, string processing, CLI parsing
 *
 * @defgroup apps Commands
 * @brief Subcommand implementations for the imrmlp CLI
 *
 * @defgroup maxvol MAXVOL
 * @brief MAXVOL algorithm for active-set selection of training structures
 *
 * @defgroup train Training
 * @brief Training algorithms for MTP and nonlinear potentials
 *
 * @defgroup nnbase Neural Network Primitives
 * @brief NN layer primitives (single/multi-hidden-layer, activation functions)
 *
 * @defgroup trajectory Trajectory
